OL,5,G1900 New Music Fix Daily
OL,6,     FDeb chats to Nis Bysted about the
OL,7,     Fmusic that has shaped his
OL,8,     Fremarkable career. Nis is a
OL,9,     Fproducer and head of cult Danish
OL,10,     Flabel Escho, whose roster includes
OL,11,     FIceage, Smerz and Fine.
OL,12,G2100 Riley & Coe
OL,13,     FGideon Coe plays his music loves
OL,14,     Ffrom every era and genre. Maisy
OL,15,     FOwen live in session.
OL,16,G2300 Loud and Proud Icons
OL,17,     FBeth Ditto is in conversation with
OL,18,     Fher LGBTQ+ icon, the OG pop
OL,19,     Fprovocateur Peaches. They discuss
OL,20,     Ftheir careers, shared love of the
OL,21,     Ftheatre and their queer legacy.
