OL,5,G0000 Freak Zone Playlist
OL,6,     FFrench pianist and composer Lara
OL,7,     FHumbert picks an hour of music
OL,8,     Fthat crosses the boundaries
OL,9,     Fbetween improvisation and pop.
OL,10,G0100 Will You Still Love Me Tomorrow?
OL,11,     FCharlotte Greig looks back to the
OL,12,     Fgirl groups of the 50s - including
OL,13,     FThe Bobbettes, The Chantels and
OL,14,     FThe Shirelles. First broadcast
OL,15,     F1990.
OL,16,G0200 Will You Still Love Me Tomorrow?
OL,17,     FCharlotte Greig looks back at the
OL,18,     Fgroups produced by Phil Spector,
OL,19,     Fincluding The Crystals and The
OL,20,     FRonettes. First broadcast in 1990.
